OL,4,Adown papers in heated exchange with
OL,5,Ajudge
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe judge is bringing in the jury one
OL,8,Fby one in the trial of Lindsay Clancy,
OL,9,Fwho is accused of killing her three
OL,10,Fsmall children in Massachusetts in 2023
OL,11,F- watch live above
OL,13,FClancy is charged with three counts of
OL,14,Ffirst-degree murder, as the prosecution
OL,15,Fargues she made a calculated,
OL,16,Fintentional decision to kill them
